msgid "HiNet Multi-Dial Controller"
msgstr ""

msgid "Dial multiple PPPoE sessions over one physical WAN port, each with its own public IP. The DHCP WAN lifeline is never touched. <strong>Save &amp; Apply</strong> creates or removes the interfaces and reloads the network; the buttons in the status table act on running sessions live."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controller"
msgstr ""

msgid "Number of sessions (IPs)"
msgstr ""

msgid "How many PPPoE sessions to dial. Each becomes wanp&lt;n&gt; with its own public IP and private routing table. Save &amp; Apply creates or removes interfaces to match."
msgstr ""

msgid "HiNet account (HN number)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Enter just the 8-digit HN number — <code>@hinet.net</code> is added automatically. Shared by every session. For another ISP, enter the full account including <code>@</code>."
msgstr ""

msgid "Enter the 8-digit HN number, or a full account containing @."
msgstr ""

