msgid "Enable WireGuard egress tunnels"
msgstr ""

msgid "Create one WG tunnel per active session (wg&lt;i&gt; → wanp&lt;i&gt;). A client connects to wan0 on a per-tunnel port; its internet traffic exits via that session's public IP, while ordinary LAN users keep using wan0. WG clients can also reach the LAN."
